    {
      "name": "Resurgence",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "T7si9kSIIpOCd3Zo",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "<p>When in Combat, the Cultist has a pool of 3 Resurgence Points. They may spend 1 Resurgence Point to gain +1SL on an Attack Test, 2 Resurgence Points to gain Advantage on any Test, or 3 Resurgence Points to reroll any Attack Test. The Cultist cannot regain the number of Resurgence Points they have spent, and can only spend Resurgence Points once per turn. If the Cultist has not spent any Resurgence Points by the time they die or are defeated, they can all be spent to revive themselves at the start of the next Round at half Wounds in a zone within Medium Range as long as it is not occupied by enemies.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
